{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RSrXqDMGY1RKjp5Nmz8JpM","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s020\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), measuring per-problem paired phase gradient\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n7\t      \"high_phase_median_ii\": 0.038,\n8\t      \"mid_phase_median_ii\": 0.285,\n9\t      \"low_phase_median_ii\": 1.98,\n10\t      \"median_difference\": 1.94,\n11\t      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n12\t        1.72,\n13\t        2.21\n14\t      ],\n15\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 2.5e-28,\n16\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.72,\n17\t      \"gradient_monotonic\": true,\n18\t      \"perplexity_high_both\": 2.85,\n19\t      \"perplexity_mid_both\": 7.9,\n20\t      \"perplexity_low_both\": 42.3\n21\t    },\n22\t    \"tables\": [\n23\t      {\n24\t        \"name\": \"Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s020)\",\n25\t        \"columns\": [\n26\t          \"phase\",\n27\t          \"n_segments\",\n28\t          \"n_tokens\",\n29\t          \"ii_median\",\n30\t          \"ii_mean\",\n31\t          \"ii_ci_low\",\n32\t          \"ii_ci_high\"\n33\t        ],\n34\t        \"rows\": [\n35\t          [\n36\t            \"high\",\n37\t            6261,\n38\t            479658,\n39\t            0.038,\n40\t            0.42,\n41\t            0.12,\n42\t            0.95\n43\t          ],\n44\t          [\n45\t            \"mid\",\n46\t            2185,\n47\t            276409,\n48\t            0.285,\n49\t            1.85,\n50\t            1.42,\n51\t            2.35\n52\t          ],\n53\t          [\n54\t            \"low\",\n55\t            5128,\n56\t            465085,\n57\t            1.98,\n58\t            12.4,\n59\t            10.6,\n60\t            14.5\n61\t          ]\n62\t        ]\n63\t      }\n64\t    ],\n65\t    \"figures\": [],\n66\t    \"analysis\": \"Phase gradient 在 s020 显著（Bonferroni-corrected p < 0.001），与 MATH-500 和 GSM8K 的 s020 级别定性一致。效应量大于 GSM8K-DS s020 (0.740 median_diff) 但基于 GPQA 更长的推理链和更多 segment 采样，统计功效充分。\\n\\n在 median 档位下，GPQA importance phase gradient 延续 s015 的强单调趋势。s015 已观测到 median_diff=0.947，s020 按 sub-exponential growth（约 2× 增长因子）预期达到 ~1.9。GPQA 推理链更长（平均 ~6000 tokens vs MATH-500 ~1200），低 sparsity phase 累积更多 compound interaction，但每 segment 平均 II 可能略低于 MATH-500（因 GPQA 推理步骤更多样化，非纯数学计算）。效应量 d_z≈0.72 介于 s015 的 ~0.55 和 MATH-500 s020 的 0.73 之间，反映 GPQA 的高方差样本特性。\"\n67\t  },\n68\t  {\n69\t    \"name\": \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s025\",\n70\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.25 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198)\",\n71\t    \"results\": {\n72\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n73\t      \"high_phase_median_ii\": 0.095,\n74\t      \"mid_phase_median_ii\": 0.72,\n75\t      \"low_phase_median_ii\": 3.65,\n76\t      \"median_difference\": 3.55,\n77\t      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n78\t        3.05,\n79\t        4.15\n80\t      ],\n81\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 8.2e-34,\n82\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.88,\n83\t      \"gradient_monotonic\": true,\n84\t      \"perplexity_high_both\": 4.2,\n85\t      \"perplexity_mid_both\": 18.5,\n86\t      \"perplexity_low_both\": 78.6\n87\t    },\n88\t    \"tables\": [\n89\t      {\n90\t        \"name\": \"Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s025)\",\n91\t        \"columns\": [\n92\t          \"phase\",\n93\t          \"n_segments\",\n94\t          \"n_tokens\",\n95\t          \"ii_median\",\n96\t          \"ii_mean\",\n97\t          \"ii_ci_low\",\n98\t          \"ii_ci_high\"\n99\t        ],\n100\t        \"rows\": [\n101\t          [\n102\t            \"high\",\n103\t            6261,\n104\t            479658,\n105\t            0.095,\n106\t            0.88,\n107\t            0.42,\n108\t            1.52\n109\t          ],\n110\t          [\n111\t            \"mid\",\n112\t            2185,\n113\t            276409,\n114\t            0.72,\n115\t            5.6,\n116\t            4.1,\n117\t            7.8\n118\t          ],\n119\t          [\n120\t            \"low\",\n121\t            5128,\n122\t            465085,\n123\t            3.65,\n124\t            28.5,\n125\t            22.8,\n126\t            35.2\n127\t          ]\n128\t        ]\n129\t      }\n130\t    ],\n131\t    \"figures\": [],\n132\t    \"analysis\": \"s025 效应量（d_z≈0.88）进入 large 区间，GPQA gradient 在量级上接近但略低于 MATH-500（3.55 vs 3.99），这与 median 档位预期一致——GPQA 的 phase gradient 存在但 specificity magnitude 不如纯数学 benchmark。\\n\\ns025 是 compound interaction 显著增强的关键拐点。在 MATH-500 上 s025 median_diff=3.99，在 median 档位下 GPQA 应与 MATH-500 数值相近但略低（~3.55），因为：(1) GPQA 问题推理路径更长但每步 reasoning 深度更浅（多为知识检索+逻辑连接而非深层数学变换），导致 per-segment compound interaction 稍弱；(2) GPQA 的 perplexity landscape 更平坦（知识检索 token 的 baseline perplexity 较高），discrimination collapse 的相对影响略减。增长因子从 s015→s020 的 2× 降至 s020→s025 的 1.8×，符合 sub-exponential 预期。\"\n133\t  },\n134\t  {\n135\t    \"name\": \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s030\",\n136\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.30 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), 关键指标实验\",\n137\t    \"results\": {\n138\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n139\t      \"high_phase_median_ii\": 0.18,\n140\t      \"mid_phase_median_ii\": 1.45,\n141\t      \"low_phase_median_ii\": 5.05,\n142\t      \"median_difference\": 4.87,\n143\t      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n144\t        3.82,\n145\t        5.95\n146\t      ],\n147\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 3.1e-36,\n148\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.95,\n149\t      \"gradient_monotonic\": true,\n150\t      \"dose_response_spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n151\t      \"perplexity_high_both\": 5.8,\n152\t      \"perplexity_mid_both\": 32.5,\n153\t      \"perplexity_low_both\": 145.2,\n154\t      \"low_high_ratio\": 28.1\n155\t    },\n156\t    \"tables\": [\n157\t      {\n158\t        \"name\": \"GPQA 4-level dose-response summary\",\n159\t        \"columns\": [\n160\t          \"sparsity\",\n161\t          \"median_diff\",\n162\t          \"ci_low\",\n163\t          \"ci_high\",\n164\t          \"cohens_dz\",\n165\t          \"wilcoxon_p\"\n166\t        ],\n167\t        \"rows\": [\n168\t          [\n169\t            \"s015\",\n170\t            0.947,\n171\t            0.88,\n172\t            1.03,\n173\t            0.55,\n174\t            1.4e-29\n175\t          ],\n176\t          [\n177\t            \"s020\",\n178\t            1.94,\n179\t            1.72,\n180\t            2.21,\n181\t            0.72,\n182\t            2.5e-28\n183\t          ],\n184\t          [\n185\t            \"s025\",\n186\t            3.55,\n187\t            3.05,\n188\t            4.15,\n189\t            0.88,\n190\t            8.2e-34\n191\t          ],\n192\t          [\n193\t            \"s030\",\n194\t            4.87,\n195\t            3.82,\n196\t            5.95,\n197\t            0.95,\n198\t            3.1e-36\n199\t          ]\n200\t        ]\n201\t      },\n202\t      {\n203\t        \"name\": \"Cross-benchmark comparison at s030\",\n204\t        \"columns\": [\n205\t          \"benchmark\",\n206\t          \"imp_median_diff_s030\",\n207\t          \"growth_factor_s025_s030\"\n208\t        ],\n209\t        \"rows\": [\n210\t          [\n211\t            \"MATH-500\",\n212\t            8.48,\n213\t            2.13\n214\t          ],\n215\t          [\n216\t            \"GPQA\",\n217\t            4.87,\n218\t            1.37\n219\t          ],\n220\t          [\n221\t            \"GSM8K\",\n222\t            4.68,\n223\t            2.35\n224\t          ]\n225\t        ]\n226\t      }\n227\t    ],\n228\t    \"figures\": [],\n229\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA s030 median_diff=4.87 确认 phase gradient 跨 benchmark 稳健。值得注意的是 GPQA 数值介于 GSM8K(4.68) 和 MATH-500(8.48) 之间，暗示 gradient magnitude 与 reasoning chain complexity 非简单线性关系——GPQA 链最长但 gradient 非最大。这可能因为 GPQA 的长链中包含更多'低复杂度'检索 segment，稀释了 per-token compound interaction 的影响。此发现支持 Discussion 中'specificity 与 reasoning depth/type 关系'的开放问题。\\n\\nmedian 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_median_diff_s030 ∈ [3.0, 6.0]。预测 4.87 落在区间中部。理由：(1) GPQA 推理链长度（~6000 tokens）意味着 low-sparsity phase 有大量 segment 累积 compound damage，但 GPQA 问题的 reasoning chain 不如 MATH-500 的逐步推导那样对 intermediate attention pattern 敏感——GPQA 更多依赖知识检索和因果推理，而非精确数值操作。(2) 从 s025→s030 增长因子约 1.4×（从 3.55 到 4.87），延续 sub-exponential 递减趋势（MATH-500 同区间增长因子 2.1×）。(3) 效应量 d_z≈0.95 接近 MATH-500 的 1.13 但未达到，因 GPQA 的 per-problem variance 更高（问题难度跨度大）。(4) 全 4 级 sparsity 构成完美单调序列（rho=1.0），确认 dose-response 在 GPQA 上成立。\"\n230\t  },\n231\t  {\n232\t    \"name\": \"GPQA DeepSeek Random s020\",\n233\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B random masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), 用于计算 imp/rand ratio\",\n234\t    \"results\": {\n235\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n236\t      \"high_phase_median_ii\": 0.022,\n237\t      \"mid_phase_median_ii\": 0.13,\n238\t      \"low_phase_median_ii\": 0.72,\n239\t      \"median_difference\": 0.7,\n240\t      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n241\t        0.38,\n242\t        1.05\n243\t      ],\n244\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0035,\n245\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.22,\n246\t      \"gradient_monotonic\": true,\n247\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_s020\": 2.77,\n248\t      \"perplexity_high_both\": 6.2,\n249\t      \"perplexity_mid_both\": 8.5,\n250\t      \"perplexity_low_both\": 15.8\n251\t    },\n252\t    \"tables\": [\n253\t      {\n254\t        \"name\": \"GPQA Strategy comparison at s020\",\n255\t        \"columns\": [\n256\t          \"strategy\",\n257\t          \"median_diff\",\n258\t          \"cohens_dz\",\n259\t          \"p_value\",\n260\t          \"significant\"\n261\t        ],\n262\t        \"rows\": [\n263\t          [\n264\t            \"importance\",\n265\t            1.94,\n266\t            0.72,\n267\t            2.5e-28,\n268\t            true\n269\t          ],\n270\t          [\n271\t            \"random\",\n272\t            0.7,\n273\t            0.22,\n274\t            0.0035,\n275\t            true\n276\t          ],\n277\t          [\n278\t            \"ratio\",\n279\t            2.77,\n280\t            \"-\",\n281\t            \"-\",\n282\t            \"-\"\n283\t          ]\n284\t        ]\n285\t      },\n286\t      {\n287\t        \"name\": \"Cross-benchmark imp/rand ratio comparison\",\n288\t        \"columns\": [\n289\t          \"benchmark\",\n290\t          \"ratio_range\",\n291\t          \"random_significant_at_s020\"\n292\t        ],\n293\t        \"rows\": [\n294\t          [\n295\t            \"MATH-500 (DS)\",\n296\t            \"15-17×\",\n297\t            \"No (NS)\"\n298\t          ],\n299\t          [\n300\t            \"GSM8K (DS)\",\n301\t            \"2.3-3.8×\",\n302\t            \"Marginal\"\n303\t          ],\n304\t          [\n305\t            \"GPQA (DS)\",\n306\t            \"2.5-3.5×\",\n307\t            \"Yes (p<0.005)\"\n308\t          ],\n309\t          [\n310\t            \"LLaMA cross-arch\",\n311\t            \"2.0-2.6×\",\n312\t            \"Yes (all conditions)\"\n313\t          ]\n314\t        ]\n315\t      }\n316\t    ],\n317\t    \"figures\": [],\n318\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA random s020 显著（p<0.005）且 gradient 方向与 importance 一致，但效应量仅为 importance 的 1/3。这与 LLaMA cross-arch 结果（ratio 2.0-2.6×）和 GSM8K（2.3-3.8×）高度一致，强化了'MATH-500 的 15-17× ratio 是 outlier 而非 norm'的结论。Strategy specificity 成为 established pattern (task-dependent) 而非 isolated anomaly——具体来说，需要短推理链 + 高精度数学计算 + Qwen2 架构才能产生极端 ratio。这要求论文将 C1 claim 拆分并加 qualifier：phase gradient universality (strong) vs specificity magnitude (qualified, driven by task×architecture interaction)。\\n\\nmedian 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 ratio=2.77（importance s020 median_diff 1.94 / random s020 median_diff 0.70）。理由：(1) 在 MATH-500 上 DeepSeek random s020 NS（median_diff≈-0.016），但在 LLaMA 上 random 所有条件显著（d_z=0.41-0.46）——GPQA 更长的推理链提供更多 statistical power 和更多 low-sparsity segment 让 random masking 的 compound effect 也能积累到可检测水平。(2) GSM8K imp/rand ratio 为 2.3-3.8×，GPQA 在 median 档位应与此一致（因为两者的 reasoning chain 长度更接近，都远长于 MATH-500 的短链）。(3) Random 的 phase gradient 存在但效应量小（d_z=0.22, small），与 LLaMA 上观测到的 random gradient 行为一致——进一步确认 strategy specificity 不是 all-or-nothing 而是 magnitude difference。(4) 这意味着 reviewers 的质疑成立：GPQA 上 random 也有显著 gradient，只是弱 2-3×，需要将'importance-specific'的 framing 改为'importance-dominant but not exclusive'。\"\n319\t  },\n320\t  {\n321\t    \"name\": \"GPQA Cross-benchmark Gradient Correlation\",\n322\t    \"description\": \"计算 GPQA importance gradient 与 MATH-500/GSM8K gradient 的跨 benchmark 相关性\",\n323\t    \"results\": {\n324\t      \"spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_math500\": 1.0,\n325\t      \"spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_gsm8k\": 1.0,\n326\t      \"cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation\": 0.92,\n327\t      \"gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_math500\": 0.57,\n328\t      \"gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_gsm8k\": 1.04\n329\t    },\n330\t    \"tables\": [\n331\t      {\n332\t        \"name\": \"4-level gradient comparison across benchmarks (DeepSeek importance)\",\n333\t        \"columns\": [\n334\t          \"sparsity\",\n335\t          \"MATH-500\",\n336\t          \"GPQA\",\n337\t          \"GSM8K\"\n338\t        ],\n339\t        \"rows\": [\n340\t          [\n341\t            \"s015\",\n342\t            0.39,\n343\t            0.947,\n344\t            0.241\n345\t          ],\n346\t          [\n347\t            \"s020\",\n348\t            1.21,\n349\t            1.94,\n350\t            0.74\n351\t          ],\n352\t          [\n353\t            \"s025\",\n354\t            3.99,\n355\t            3.55,\n356\t            1.992\n357\t          ],\n358\t          [\n359\t            \"s030\",\n360\t            8.48,\n361\t            4.87,\n362\t            4.682\n363\t          ]\n364\t        ]\n365\t      },\n366\t      {\n367\t        \"name\": \"Growth factors between adjacent levels\",\n368\t        \"columns\": [\n369\t          \"transition\",\n370\t          \"MATH-500\",\n371\t          \"GPQA\",\n372\t          \"GSM8K\"\n373\t        ],\n374\t        \"rows\": [\n375\t          [\n376\t            \"s015→s020\",\n377\t            \"3.1×\",\n378\t            \"2.0×\",\n379\t            \"3.1×\"\n380\t          ],\n381\t          [\n382\t            \"s020→s025\",\n383\t            \"3.3×\",\n384\t            \"1.8×\",\n385\t            \"2.7×\"\n386\t          ],\n387\t          [\n388\t            \"s025→s030\",\n389\t            \"2.1×\",\n390\t            \"1.4×\",\n391\t            \"2.4×\"\n392\t          ]\n393\t        ]\n394\t      }\n395\t    ],\n396\t    \"figures\": [],\n397\t    \"analysis\": \"跨 benchmark 相关性 0.92 支持 phase gradient universality 的 strong claim。但 GPQA 的 sub-exponential decay 明显快于 MATH-500（s025→s030 仅 1.4× vs 2.1×），暗示 GPQA 的 reasoning 在 extreme sparsity 下可能已接近 ceiling effect（compound interaction 饱和），而 MATH-500 的精确计算链仍有空间进一步恶化。\\n\\nmedian 档位约束 cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation ∈ [0.85, 0.95]。预测 0.92：三个 benchmark 的 4-level dose-response 均为完美单调（Spearman ρ=1.0 each），但 absolute magnitude 和 growth rate 不同。Pearson correlation on log-scale gradient magnitudes 给出 0.92（低于 1.0 因为 growth factor 的 benchmark-specific 差异：MATH-500 growth 3.8→4.8→2.1，GPQA growth 2.0→1.8→1.4，GSM8K growth 3.1→2.7→2.4）。这意味着 phase gradient 的定性模式（方向+单调性）完全 universal，但定量曲线形状 task-dependent——sufficient for 'phase gradient universality' strong claim，但 slope/curvature 需加 qualifier。\"\n398\t  },\n399\t  {\n400\t    \"name\": \"GPQA Strategy Specificity Summary (projected)\",\n401\t    \"description\": \"汇总 GPQA 上 importance vs random 的 phase gradient 差异，计算 imp/rand ratio 跨 sparsity levels\",\n402\t    \"results\": {\n403\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_s015\": 3.2,\n404\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_s020\": 2.8,\n405\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 3.5,\n406\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 2.9,\n407\t      \"mean_imp_rand_ratio\": 3.1,\n408\t      \"random_significant_fraction\": 0.75,\n409\t      \"strategy_x_phase_interaction_p\": 0.008\n410\t    },\n411\t    \"tables\": [\n412\t      {\n413\t        \"name\": \"GPQA imp/rand ratio by sparsity level\",\n414\t        \"columns\": [\n415\t          \"sparsity\",\n416\t          \"imp_median_diff\",\n417\t          \"rand_median_diff\",\n418\t          \"ratio\",\n419\t          \"rand_significant\"\n420\t        ],\n421\t        \"rows\": [\n422\t          [\n423\t            \"s015\",\n424\t            0.947,\n425\t            0.3,\n426\t            3.2,\n427\t            \"marginal (p=0.04)\"\n428\t          ],\n429\t          [\n430\t            \"s020\",\n431\t            1.94,\n432\t            0.7,\n433\t            2.8,\n434\t            \"yes (p=0.004)\"\n435\t          ],\n436\t          [\n437\t            \"s025\",\n438\t            3.55,\n439\t            1.01,\n440\t            3.5,\n441\t            \"yes (p<0.001)\"\n442\t          ],\n443\t          [\n444\t            \"s030\",\n445\t            4.87,\n446\t            1.68,\n447\t            2.9,\n448\t            \"yes (p<0.001)\"\n449\t          ]\n450\t        ]\n451\t      },\n452\t      {\n453\t        \"name\": \"Strategy specificity across all benchmarks\",\n454\t        \"columns\": [\n455\t          \"benchmark\",\n456\t          \"mean_ratio\",\n457\t          \"ratio_range\",\n458\t          \"pattern\"\n459\t        ],\n460\t        \"rows\": [\n461\t          [\n462\t            \"MATH-500 (DS n=500)\",\n463\t            22.4,\n464\t            \"15.5-38.6×\",\n465\t            \"random NS at s015/s020; extreme separation\"\n466\t          ],\n467\t          [\n468\t            \"GSM8K (DS n=50)\",\n469\t            2.9,\n470\t            \"2.3-3.8×\",\n471\t            \"random gradient exists but weaker\"\n472\t          ],\n473\t          [\n474\t            \"GPQA (DS n=198)\",\n475\t            3.1,\n476\t            \"2.8-3.5×\",\n477\t            \"random mostly significant; moderate separation\"\n478\t          ],\n479\t          [\n480\t            \"LLaMA cross-arch (n=250)\",\n481\t            2.3,\n482\t            \"2.0-2.6×\",\n483\t            \"random all significant; minimal separation\"\n484\t          ]\n485\t        ]\n486\t      }\n487\t    ],\n488\t    \"figures\": [],\n489\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA ratio 3.1 与 GSM8K (2.9) 和 LLaMA (2.3) 形成 cluster，远离 MATH-500 (22.4) 的离群值。这确立了'strategy specificity magnitude is task-dependent'作为 robust pattern 而非 isolated observation。Reviewers 会认可 phase gradient universality 但要求将 specificity claim 降调。Discussion 需新增段落分析 possible mechanism：MATH-500 的极端 ratio 可能源于数学计算的 attention pattern 高度结构化（特定 head 专注于操作数关系），使 importance eviction 造成的 discrimination collapse 影响远大于 random 的 uniform damage；而 GPQA/GSM8K 的推理更多依赖分布式知识表示，两种 eviction 造成的损伤更均匀。\\n\\nmedian 档位约束 gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 mean ratio=3.1，落在区间中下部。理由：(1) GPQA 长推理链给 random masking 更多机会累积 compound effect，缩小与 importance 的差距；(2) ratio 跨 sparsity level 相对稳定（2.8-3.5）而非随 sparsity 增大而扩大（这与 MATH-500 不同，后者 ratio 从 s015 的 28× 到 s030 的 17× 虽在缩小但始终极端）；(3) random 在多数条件下显著（3/4 significant after Bonferroni），与 LLaMA 行为模式一致而非 MATH-500-DeepSeek 的 random-NS 模式。(4) Strategy×phase 交互仍显著（p<0.01）但 F 值远小于 MATH-500 的版本，Reviewers 会接受 interaction 存在但要求 magnitude 相关 claims 加 qualifier。\"\n490\t  },\n491\t  {\n492\t    \"name\": \"Expected Reviewer Scores (median tier)\",\n493\t    \"description\": \"基于 GPQA 结果和完整证据链预测 reviewer 评分\",\n494\t    \"results\": {\n495\t      \"reviewer_1_score\": 3.5,\n496\t      \"reviewer_2_score\": 3.0,\n497\t      \"reviewer_3_score\": 3.5,\n498\t      \"average_score\": 3.33,\n499\t      \"novelty_score\": 3.25,\n500\t      \"soundness_score\": 3.5,\n501\t      \"significance_score\": 3.0,\n502\t      \"clarity_score\": 3.5\n503\t    },\n504\t    \"tables\": [\n505\t      {\n506\t        \"name\": \"Projected reviewer feedback summary\",\n507\t        \"columns\": [\n508\t          \"aspect\",\n509\t          \"consensus\",\n510\t          \"dissent\"\n511\t        ],\n512\t        \"rows\": [\n513\t          [\n514\t            \"phase gradient universality\",\n515\t            \"accepted (strong evidence)\",\n516\t            \"none\"\n517\t          ],\n518\t          [\n519\t            \"strategy specificity magnitude\",\n520\t            \"requires qualifier\",\n521\t            \"R2 wants this demoted to secondary finding\"\n522\t          ],\n523\t          [\n524\t            \"recency control novelty\",\n525\t            \"recognized as contribution\",\n526\t            \"R2 questions if methodological innovation warrants inclusion\"\n527\t          ],\n528\t          [\n529\t            \"7B scale limitation\",\n530\t            \"acknowledged in limitations\",\n531\t            \"R1 suggests at least one 13B+ data point\"\n532\t          ],\n533\t          [\n534\t            \"architecture dependence\",\n535\t            \"interesting open question\",\n536\t            \"R3 wants more mechanistic speculation\"\n537\t          ]\n538\t        ]\n539\t      }\n540\t    ],\n541\t    \"figures\": [],\n542\t    \"analysis\": \"Average 3.33 is borderline accept at EMNLP。关键 rebuttal 策略：(1) 强调 phase gradient universality 的 unprecedented evidence breadth (3 benchmarks × 3 architectures × 4 sparsity levels)；(2) 主动承认 specificity is task-dependent 并 frame 为 positive contribution（发现了影响 specificity 的 factors，不是 limitation 而是 nuanced understanding）；(3) 对 R2 的 practical impact concern，指向 recency control 作为 future phase-aware system design 的基础。\\n\\nmedian 档位约束 expected_reviewer_avg_score ∈ [3.0, 3.5], novelty_score ∈ [3.0, 3.5]。Reviewer 1（方法论专家）给 3.5：认可 recency control 的 experimental design contribution 和 triple dissociation 的清晰性，但对 7B-only scale 有轻微保留。Reviewer 2（efficiency/systems 方向）给 3.0：认可 finding 的 empirical rigor 但质疑'so what'——phase gradient 的 practical implication 不够清晰，C5b mitigation pilot 失败削弱了 impact story。Reviewer 3（NLP/reasoning 方向）给 3.5：对 cross-benchmark 分析和 task-dependent specificity 的 open question framing 表示欣赏，认为这为 future work 打开了有意义的方向。共同关注点：(a) specificity claim 需要 qualifier（全部三人），(b) 7B scale limitation（2/3），(c) architecture dependence 需更多讨论（1/3）。\"\n543\t  }\n544\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"97a9cd81-ba87-49e9-a10b-99773284eb03","uuid":"ca84cc0b-5a13-4354-a611-0199d610fbda","timestamp":"2026-05-17T03:45:43.377Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T032843/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s020\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), measuring per-problem paired phase gradient\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"high_phase_median_ii\": 0.038,\n      \"mid_phase_median_ii\": 0.285,\n      \"low_phase_median_ii\": 1.98,\n      \"median_difference\": 1.94,\n      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n        1.72,\n        2.21\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 2.5e-28,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.72,\n      \"gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"perplexity_high_both\": 2.85,\n      \"perplexity_mid_both\": 7.9,\n      \"perplexity_low_both\": 42.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s020)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"phase\",\n          \"n_segments\",\n          \"n_tokens\",\n          \"ii_median\",\n          \"ii_mean\",\n          \"ii_ci_low\",\n          \"ii_ci_high\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"high\",\n            6261,\n            479658,\n            0.038,\n            0.42,\n            0.12,\n            0.95\n          ],\n          [\n            \"mid\",\n            2185,\n            276409,\n            0.285,\n            1.85,\n            1.42,\n            2.35\n          ],\n          [\n            \"low\",\n            5128,\n            465085,\n            1.98,\n            12.4,\n            10.6,\n            14.5\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Phase gradient 在 s020 显著（Bonferroni-corrected p < 0.001），与 MATH-500 和 GSM8K 的 s020 级别定性一致。效应量大于 GSM8K-DS s020 (0.740 median_diff) 但基于 GPQA 更长的推理链和更多 segment 采样，统计功效充分。\\n\\n在 median 档位下，GPQA importance phase gradient 延续 s015 的强单调趋势。s015 已观测到 median_diff=0.947，s020 按 sub-exponential growth（约 2× 增长因子）预期达到 ~1.9。GPQA 推理链更长（平均 ~6000 tokens vs MATH-500 ~1200），低 sparsity phase 累积更多 compound interaction，但每 segment 平均 II 可能略低于 MATH-500（因 GPQA 推理步骤更多样化，非纯数学计算）。效应量 d_z≈0.72 介于 s015 的 ~0.55 和 MATH-500 s020 的 0.73 之间，反映 GPQA 的高方差样本特性。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s025\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.25 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198)\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"high_phase_median_ii\": 0.095,\n      \"mid_phase_median_ii\": 0.72,\n      \"low_phase_median_ii\": 3.65,\n      \"median_difference\": 3.55,\n      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n        3.05,\n        4.15\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 8.2e-34,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.88,\n      \"gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"perplexity_high_both\": 4.2,\n      \"perplexity_mid_both\": 18.5,\n      \"perplexity_low_both\": 78.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s025)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"phase\",\n          \"n_segments\",\n          \"n_tokens\",\n          \"ii_median\",\n          \"ii_mean\",\n          \"ii_ci_low\",\n          \"ii_ci_high\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"high\",\n            6261,\n            479658,\n            0.095,\n            0.88,\n            0.42,\n            1.52\n          ],\n          [\n            \"mid\",\n            2185,\n            276409,\n            0.72,\n            5.6,\n            4.1,\n            7.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"low\",\n            5128,\n            465085,\n            3.65,\n            28.5,\n            22.8,\n            35.2\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"s025 效应量（d_z≈0.88）进入 large 区间，GPQA gradient 在量级上接近但略低于 MATH-500（3.55 vs 3.99），这与 median 档位预期一致——GPQA 的 phase gradient 存在但 specificity magnitude 不如纯数学 benchmark。\\n\\ns025 是 compound interaction 显著增强的关键拐点。在 MATH-500 上 s025 median_diff=3.99，在 median 档位下 GPQA 应与 MATH-500 数值相近但略低（~3.55），因为：(1) GPQA 问题推理路径更长但每步 reasoning 深度更浅（多为知识检索+逻辑连接而非深层数学变换），导致 per-segment compound interaction 稍弱；(2) GPQA 的 perplexity landscape 更平坦（知识检索 token 的 baseline perplexity 较高），discrimination collapse 的相对影响略减。增长因子从 s015→s020 的 2× 降至 s020→s025 的 1.8×，符合 sub-exponential 预期。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s030\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.30 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), 关键指标实验\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"high_phase_median_ii\": 0.18,\n      \"mid_phase_median_ii\": 1.45,\n      \"low_phase_median_ii\": 5.05,\n      \"median_difference\": 4.87,\n      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n        3.82,\n        5.95\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 3.1e-36,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.95,\n      \"gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n      \"perplexity_high_both\": 5.8,\n      \"perplexity_mid_both\": 32.5,\n      \"perplexity_low_both\": 145.2,\n      \"low_high_ratio\": 28.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"GPQA 4-level dose-response summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"median_diff\",\n          \"ci_low\",\n          \"ci_high\",\n          \"cohens_dz\",\n          \"wilcoxon_p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            0.947,\n            0.88,\n            1.03,\n            0.55,\n            1.4e-29\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            1.94,\n            1.72,\n            2.21,\n            0.72,\n            2.5e-28\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            3.55,\n            3.05,\n            4.15,\n            0.88,\n            8.2e-34\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            4.87,\n            3.82,\n            5.95,\n            0.95,\n            3.1e-36\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-benchmark comparison at s030\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"imp_median_diff_s030\",\n          \"growth_factor_s025_s030\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            8.48,\n            2.13\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPQA\",\n            4.87,\n            1.37\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            4.68,\n            2.35\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA s030 median_diff=4.87 确认 phase gradient 跨 benchmark 稳健。值得注意的是 GPQA 数值介于 GSM8K(4.68) 和 MATH-500(8.48) 之间，暗示 gradient magnitude 与 reasoning chain complexity 非简单线性关系——GPQA 链最长但 gradient 非最大。这可能因为 GPQA 的长链中包含更多'低复杂度'检索 segment，稀释了 per-token compound interaction 的影响。此发现支持 Discussion 中'specificity 与 reasoning depth/type 关系'的开放问题。\\n\\nmedian 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_median_diff_s030 ∈ [3.0, 6.0]。预测 4.87 落在区间中部。理由：(1) GPQA 推理链长度（~6000 tokens）意味着 low-sparsity phase 有大量 segment 累积 compound damage，但 GPQA 问题的 reasoning chain 不如 MATH-500 的逐步推导那样对 intermediate attention pattern 敏感——GPQA 更多依赖知识检索和因果推理，而非精确数值操作。(2) 从 s025→s030 增长因子约 1.4×（从 3.55 到 4.87），延续 sub-exponential 递减趋势（MATH-500 同区间增长因子 2.1×）。(3) 效应量 d_z≈0.95 接近 MATH-500 的 1.13 但未达到，因 GPQA 的 per-problem variance 更高（问题难度跨度大）。(4) 全 4 级 sparsity 构成完美单调序列（rho=1.0），确认 dose-response 在 GPQA 上成立。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GPQA DeepSeek Random s020\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B random masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), 用于计算 imp/rand ratio\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"high_phase_median_ii\": 0.022,\n      \"mid_phase_median_ii\": 0.13,\n      \"low_phase_median_ii\": 0.72,\n      \"median_difference\": 0.7,\n      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n        0.38,\n        1.05\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0035,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.22,\n      \"gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_s020\": 2.77,\n      \"perplexity_high_both\": 6.2,\n      \"perplexity_mid_both\": 8.5,\n      \"perplexity_low_both\": 15.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"GPQA Strategy comparison at s020\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"strategy\",\n          \"median_diff\",\n          \"cohens_dz\",\n          \"p_value\",\n          \"significant\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"importance\",\n            1.94,\n            0.72,\n            2.5e-28,\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"random\",\n            0.7,\n            0.22,\n            0.0035,\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ratio\",\n            2.77,\n            \"-\",\n            \"-\",\n            \"-\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-benchmark imp/rand ratio comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"ratio_range\",\n          \"random_significant_at_s020\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MATH-500 (DS)\",\n            \"15-17×\",\n            \"No (NS)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K (DS)\",\n            \"2.3-3.8×\",\n            \"Marginal\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPQA (DS)\",\n            \"2.5-3.5×\",\n            \"Yes (p<0.005)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LLaMA cross-arch\",\n            \"2.0-2.6×\",\n            \"Yes (all conditions)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA random s020 显著（p<0.005）且 gradient 方向与 importance 一致，但效应量仅为 importance 的 1/3。这与 LLaMA cross-arch 结果（ratio 2.0-2.6×）和 GSM8K（2.3-3.8×）高度一致，强化了'MATH-500 的 15-17× ratio 是 outlier 而非 norm'的结论。Strategy specificity 成为 established pattern (task-dependent) 而非 isolated anomaly——具体来说，需要短推理链 + 高精度数学计算 + Qwen2 架构才能产生极端 ratio。这要求论文将 C1 claim 拆分并加 qualifier：phase gradient universality (strong) vs specificity magnitude (qualified, driven by task×architecture interaction)。\\n\\nmedian 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 ratio=2.77（importance s020 median_diff 1.94 / random s020 median_diff 0.70）。理由：(1) 在 MATH-500 上 DeepSeek random s020 NS（median_diff≈-0.016），但在 LLaMA 上 random 所有条件显著（d_z=0.41-0.46）——GPQA 更长的推理链提供更多 statistical power 和更多 low-sparsity segment 让 random masking 的 compound effect 也能积累到可检测水平。(2) GSM8K imp/rand ratio 为 2.3-3.8×，GPQA 在 median 档位应与此一致（因为两者的 reasoning chain 长度更接近，都远长于 MATH-500 的短链）。(3) Random 的 phase gradient 存在但效应量小（d_z=0.22, small），与 LLaMA 上观测到的 random gradient 行为一致——进一步确认 strategy specificity 不是 all-or-nothing 而是 magnitude difference。(4) 这意味着 reviewers 的质疑成立：GPQA 上 random 也有显著 gradient，只是弱 2-3×，需要将'importance-specific'的 framing 改为'importance-dominant but not exclusive'。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GPQA Cross-benchmark Gradient Correlation\",\n    \"description\": \"计算 GPQA importance gradient 与 MATH-500/GSM8K gradient 的跨 benchmark 相关性\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_math500\": 1.0,\n      \"spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_gsm8k\": 1.0,\n      \"cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation\": 0.92,\n      \"gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_math500\": 0.57,\n      \"gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_gsm8k\": 1.04\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"4-level gradient comparison across benchmarks (DeepSeek importance)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"MATH-500\",\n          \"GPQA\",\n          \"GSM8K\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            0.39,\n            0.947,\n            0.241\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            1.21,\n            1.94,\n            0.74\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            3.99,\n            3.55,\n            1.992\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            8.48,\n            4.87,\n            4.682\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Growth factors between adjacent levels\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"transition\",\n          \"MATH-500\",\n          \"GPQA\",\n          \"GSM8K\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015→s020\",\n            \"3.1×\",\n            \"2.0×\",\n            \"3.1×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020→s025\",\n            \"3.3×\",\n            \"1.8×\",\n            \"2.7×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025→s030\",\n            \"2.1×\",\n            \"1.4×\",\n            \"2.4×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"跨 benchmark 相关性 0.92 支持 phase gradient universality 的 strong claim。但 GPQA 的 sub-exponential decay 明显快于 MATH-500（s025→s030 仅 1.4× vs 2.1×），暗示 GPQA 的 reasoning 在 extreme sparsity 下可能已接近 ceiling effect（compound interaction 饱和），而 MATH-500 的精确计算链仍有空间进一步恶化。\\n\\nmedian 档位约束 cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation ∈ [0.85, 0.95]。预测 0.92：三个 benchmark 的 4-level dose-response 均为完美单调（Spearman ρ=1.0 each），但 absolute magnitude 和 growth rate 不同。Pearson correlation on log-scale gradient magnitudes 给出 0.92（低于 1.0 因为 growth factor 的 benchmark-specific 差异：MATH-500 growth 3.8→4.8→2.1，GPQA growth 2.0→1.8→1.4，GSM8K growth 3.1→2.7→2.4）。这意味着 phase gradient 的定性模式（方向+单调性）完全 universal，但定量曲线形状 task-dependent——sufficient for 'phase gradient universality' strong claim，但 slope/curvature 需加 qualifier。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GPQA Strategy Specificity Summary (projected)\",\n    \"description\": \"汇总 GPQA 上 importance vs random 的 phase gradient 差异，计算 imp/rand ratio 跨 sparsity levels\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_s015\": 3.2,\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_s020\": 2.8,\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 3.5,\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 2.9,\n      \"mean_imp_rand_ratio\": 3.1,\n      \"random_significant_fraction\": 0.75,\n      \"strategy_x_phase_interaction_p\": 0.008\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"GPQA imp/rand ratio by sparsity level\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"imp_median_diff\",\n          \"rand_median_diff\",\n          \"ratio\",\n          \"rand_significant\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            0.947,\n            0.3,\n            3.2,\n            \"marginal (p=0.04)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            1.94,\n            0.7,\n            2.8,\n            \"yes (p=0.004)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            3.55,\n            1.01,\n            3.5,\n            \"yes (p<0.001)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            4.87,\n            1.68,\n            2.9,\n            \"yes (p<0.001)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Strategy specificity across all benchmarks\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"mean_ratio\",\n          \"ratio_range\",\n          \"pattern\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MATH-500 (DS n=500)\",\n            22.4,\n            \"15.5-38.6×\",\n            \"random NS at s015/s020; extreme separation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K (DS n=50)\",\n            2.9,\n            \"2.3-3.8×\",\n            \"random gradient exists but weaker\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPQA (DS n=198)\",\n            3.1,\n            \"2.8-3.5×\",\n            \"random mostly significant; moderate separation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LLaMA cross-arch (n=250)\",\n            2.3,\n            \"2.0-2.6×\",\n            \"random all significant; minimal separation\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA ratio 3.1 与 GSM8K (2.9) 和 LLaMA (2.3) 形成 cluster，远离 MATH-500 (22.4) 的离群值。这确立了'strategy specificity magnitude is task-dependent'作为 robust pattern 而非 isolated observation。Reviewers 会认可 phase gradient universality 但要求将 specificity claim 降调。Discussion 需新增段落分析 possible mechanism：MATH-500 的极端 ratio 可能源于数学计算的 attention pattern 高度结构化（特定 head 专注于操作数关系），使 importance eviction 造成的 discrimination collapse 影响远大于 random 的 uniform damage；而 GPQA/GSM8K 的推理更多依赖分布式知识表示，两种 eviction 造成的损伤更均匀。\\n\\nmedian 档位约束 gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 mean ratio=3.1，落在区间中下部。理由：(1) GPQA 长推理链给 random masking 更多机会累积 compound effect，缩小与 importance 的差距；(2) ratio 跨 sparsity level 相对稳定（2.8-3.5）而非随 sparsity 增大而扩大（这与 MATH-500 不同，后者 ratio 从 s015 的 28× 到 s030 的 17× 虽在缩小但始终极端）；(3) random 在多数条件下显著（3/4 significant after Bonferroni），与 LLaMA 行为模式一致而非 MATH-500-DeepSeek 的 random-NS 模式。(4) Strategy×phase 交互仍显著（p<0.01）但 F 值远小于 MATH-500 的版本，Reviewers 会接受 interaction 存在但要求 magnitude 相关 claims 加 qualifier。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Expected Reviewer Scores (median tier)\",\n    \"description\": \"基于 GPQA 结果和完整证据链预测 reviewer 评分\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"reviewer_1_score\": 3.5,\n      \"reviewer_2_score\": 3.0,\n      \"reviewer_3_score\": 3.5,\n      \"average_score\": 3.33,\n      \"novelty_score\": 3.25,\n      \"soundness_score\": 3.5,\n      \"significance_score\": 3.0,\n      \"clarity_score\": 3.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Projected reviewer feedback summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"aspect\",\n          \"consensus\",\n          \"dissent\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"phase gradient universality\",\n            \"accepted (strong evidence)\",\n            \"none\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"strategy specificity magnitude\",\n            \"requires qualifier\",\n            \"R2 wants this demoted to secondary finding\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"recency control novelty\",\n            \"recognized as contribution\",\n            \"R2 questions if methodological innovation warrants inclusion\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"7B scale limitation\",\n            \"acknowledged in limitations\",\n            \"R1 suggests at least one 13B+ data point\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"architecture dependence\",\n            \"interesting open question\",\n            \"R3 wants more mechanistic speculation\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Average 3.33 is borderline accept at EMNLP。关键 rebuttal 策略：(1) 强调 phase gradient universality 的 unprecedented evidence breadth (3 benchmarks × 3 architectures × 4 sparsity levels)；(2) 主动承认 specificity is task-dependent 并 frame 为 positive contribution（发现了影响 specificity 的 factors，不是 limitation 而是 nuanced understanding）；(3) 对 R2 的 practical impact concern，指向 recency control 作为 future phase-aware system design 的基础。\\n\\nmedian 档位约束 expected_reviewer_avg_score ∈ [3.0, 3.5], novelty_score ∈ [3.0, 3.5]。Reviewer 1（方法论专家）给 3.5：认可 recency control 的 experimental design contribution 和 triple dissociation 的清晰性，但对 7B-only scale 有轻微保留。Reviewer 2（efficiency/systems 方向）给 3.0：认可 finding 的 empirical rigor 但质疑'so what'——phase gradient 的 practical implication 不够清晰，C5b mitigation pilot 失败削弱了 impact story。Reviewer 3（NLP/reasoning 方向）给 3.5：对 cross-benchmark 分析和 task-dependent specificity 的 open question framing 表示欣赏，认为这为 future work 打开了有意义的方向。共同关注点：(a) specificity claim 需要 qualifier（全部三人），(b) 7B scale limitation（2/3），(c) architecture dependence 需更多讨论（1/3）。\"\n  }\n]","numLines":544,"startLine":1,"totalLines":544}}}
